  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[Psi]", "lr"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "9c6b9fa9-1cb2-4f72-8ca9-dcc1ef944e5d"],
 " to this form at some large ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["r", "f"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "94b2c1c1-30ca-42d4-bcb9-7db687add1f7"],
